OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 20 MAY
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GPetroc Trelawny visits the Cutty
OL,6,     GSark to hear about an immersive
OL,7,     Gproduction of Purcell's Dido and
OL,8,     GAeneas, and violinist Daniel
OL,9,     GPioro and harpsichordist David
OL,10,     GGordon perform live.
OL,11,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,12,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,13,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,14,     Gfavourites, with music by
OL,15,     GSibelius, Tallis and Hania Rani.
OL,16,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,17,     GThe Ulster Orchestra is joined by
OL,18,     Ga stellar line-up of soloists for
OL,19,     GStravinsky's witty Pulcinella and
OL,20,     Ga performance of Schubert's
OL,21,     Gmajestic Symphony No. 9, The
OL,22,     GGreat.
